meta {
  name: Reactions - Toggle on a post
  type: http
  seq: 45
}

post {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/communities/nswswk8w8wso0ko8owwk8k0w/spaces/<cuid of a discussion space>/posts/<post cuid>/reactions
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "emoji": "👍"
  }
}

docs {
  Adds the reaction of the member, or removes it when it exists. emoji: any emoji of the picker (#1204), skin tone included. An item takes at most 20 different emoji (422 above). Returns the summary: count per emoji, in the order of the first reaction, and whether the member reacted. Rate limited: 60 per minute.
}
